THEORY
File System Analysis Using Autopsy is a digital forensics platform and graphical interface to
The Sleuth Kite and other digital forensics tools. Law enforcement, military, and corporate
examiners use it to investigate what happened on a computer. You can even use it to recover
photos from your camera’s memory card. It can be directly used to find evidence.
